Yes, this page covers the issue very well. A few additional comments on
what is written...

  "One caveat with this strategy of mapping only alternate levels is
   that later on, when you are dragged down by the mysterious force,
   you may land in an unmapped area of the level. Therefore, it is a
   good idea to have teleport control so that you can teleport directly
   to the upstairs when this happens."

This situation is not too bad even without TC; the Amulet will occasionally
do a clairvoyance mapping, which helps a lot speeding up the process. (This
is mentioned in the paragraph about Claivoyance.) I usually even leave some
not so relevant levels (between Valley and Vlad) completely unexplored.
Until you've got the Amulet you may have found additional loot like markers,
or mapping scrolls. Flexibility in your applied tactics is what counts, IMO.

WRT finding Vlad's Tower you should observe that there's only five possible
levels. Magic mapping this range I consider most effective; on average you
need just three scrolls (for Vlad) and you map both upstairs at once that
way.

WRT the Vibrating Square level; if you do Gehennom bottom up you just have
to controlled levelport to level 55+ and will land on the VS level.

WRT Demon Mapping; this is a quite limited suggestion. You can generalize
that by the observation that major liches also flee to the upstairs if
significantly hurt. You will typically find those liches on the lower
levels of Gehennom. That's one reason why it's nice to explore Gehennom
bottom-up (which is not explicitly mentioned on that page as an effective
base principle). Also note that Asmodeus' lair can be quite away from the
Valley; you may need to explore up to five levels completely before you
reach Asmodeus' level. Later on all major demons will show you the upstairs;
you may want to take advantage of Baalzebub and Juiblex (but not Orcus,
because you will want his wand fully charged) BTW, a special case is
Juiblex; he will not only show you the upstairs, but in case you fight him
while swallowed he will also port you to the stairs - that process needs
some care, though.

